     2,
     "On Mon, 2016-04-11 at 12:23 -0700, Henrique wrote:\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt;  \r<br>&gt; Hi,\r<br>&gt; I want to estimate franciscana (Pontoporia blainvillei) bycatch for\r<br>&gt; six different areas. The model was structured as follow:\r<br>&gt;         \r<br>&gt;                                                              \r<br>&gt; formulaM3=y~0+Intercept+area+offset(LogRede)+f(s,model=spde)+f(Year,m\r<br>&gt; odel=&quot;iid&quot;)\r<br>&gt; M3=inla(formulaM3,family=&quot;Poisson&quot;,data=inla.stack.data(stk.est),cont\r<br>&gt; rol.compute=list(dic=TRUE),\r<br>&gt; control.predictor=(list(A=inla.stack.A(stk.est))))\r<br>&gt;  \r<br>&gt; My question is: How I do the prediction of franciscana bycatch for\r<br>&gt; each area?\r<br>&gt;  \r<br>&gt; sim &lt;- franciscanafit$sims.matrix\r<br>&gt; yarea1&lt;- 1/(1+exp(-sim[,1]))\r<br>&gt; yarea2 &lt;- 1/(1+exp(-(sim[,1]+sim[,2])))\r<br>&gt; yArea3 &lt;- 1/(1+exp(-(sim[,1]+sim[,3])))\r<br>&gt; yArea4 &lt;- 1/(1+exp(-(sim[,1]+sim[,4])))\r<br>&gt; yArea5 &lt;- 1/(1+exp(-(sim[,1]+sim[,5])))\r<br>&gt; yArea6 &lt;- 1/(1+exp(-(sim[,1]+sim[,6])))\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "Hi\r<br>\r<br>how is &#39;sims.matrix&#39; related to the model above? \r<br>\r<br>H\r<br>\r<br>-- \r<br>Håvard Rue\r<br>Department of Mathematical Sciences\r<br>Norwegian University of Science and Technology\r<br>N-7491 Trondheim, Norway\r<br>Voice:  <a href=\"tel:+47%2073%2059%2035%2033\" value=\"+4773593533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+47-7359-3533</a>    URL  : <a href=\"http://www.math.ntnu.no/~hrue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.math.ntnu.no/~hrue&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445104664000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13sN6K9wAiHJbhmEvdFRZX\">http://www.math.ntnu.no/~hrue</a>  \r<br>Mobile: <a href=\"tel:+47%2092%2060%2000%2021\" value=\"+4792600021\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+47-9260-0021</a>    Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">havar...@math.ntnu.no</a>\r<br>\r<br>R-INLA: <a href=\"http://www.r-inla.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-inla.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445104664000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JXMSPLgFnJ9TVRJP6DOmv\">www.r-inla.org</a>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>"
